i/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-05T14:18:51Z","updated_at":"2026-02-05T14:18:51Z","body":"Thanks. I see some issues that could arise with that method, but for now it works.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3853980902/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3854399343","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115908#issuecomment-3854399343","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115908","id":3854399343,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7lvXdv","user":{"login":"jmorel-jfc-albi","id":253939132,"node_id":"U_kgDODyLNvA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/253939132?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi","html_url":"https://github.com/jmorel-jfc-albi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-05T15:30:09Z","updated_at":"2026-02-06T09:57:15Z","body":"This will feel stupid but somehow this differentiate the creation from loading:\n```gdscript\n@tool\nclass_name YourClassName extends SomeNode\n\nfunc _init() -> void:\n\tif Engine.is_editor_hint():\n\t\tset_meta(&\"_n23\", 0)\n\nfunc _property_can_revert(property: StringName) -> bool:\n\treturn property in [&\"prop1\", &\"prop2\"]\n\nfunc _property_get_revert(property: StringName) -> Variant:\n\tmatch property:\n\t\t&\"prop1\": return value1\n\t\t&\"prop2\": return value2\n\treturn null\n\nfunc _on_node_created():\n\tprop1 = property_get_revert(&\"prop1\")\n\tprop2 = property_get_revert(&\"prop2\")\n\nfunc _notification(what: int) -> void:\n\tif !(Engine.is_editor_hint() && has_meta(&\"_n23\")):\n\t\treturn\n\tvar n23: int = get_meta(&\"_n23\")\n\tif what == NOTIFICATION_PATH_RENAMED:\n\t\tset_meta(&\"_n23\", n23 + 1)\n\t\treturn\n\tremove_meta(&\"_n23\")\n\t# notes:\n\t# - starting with 2 NOTIFICATION_PATH_RENAMED gives the creation sequence\n\t# - starting with 1 NOTIFICATION_PATH_RENAMED gives the duplication sequence\n\t# - starting with 0 NOTIFICATION_PATH_RENAMED gives the loading sequence\n\tif n23 == 0:\n\t\t# node loaded\n\t\tpass\n\telif n23 == 1:\n\t\t# node duplicated\n\t\tpass\n\telif n23 == 2:\n\t\t# node created\n\t\t_on_node_created()\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3854399343/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]